parent: pm-n7rr
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Added history redact/repair/compact/activity/restore with shared SDK behavior and legacy spellings; unified contracts, addressing, output, refusal recovery, SDK/MCP discovery and shell completion. Published integration documentation and regenerated contract surfaces."
expected_result: Native commands preserve legacy flags/output and default history view while giving agents consistent progressive discovery and recovery.
actual_result: "All 8536 tests passed with exact 100/100/100/100; linked namespace/completion tests, static gates, packed npx/bunx smoke, npm/Bun installed candidate parity and SDK execution passed. Today existing immutable release was verified separately; new code awaits the next eligible daily release."
